# Allow-list (owner rule 2026-08-30): under custom/ ONLY the station layer
# custom/evaldo-sp/ is versioned and pushed to GitHub. Everything else here
# (docs/ with PDF/PPTX and build tooling, local/ with third-party reference
# clones and wheels, anything added later) stays on this machine and must
# never be exposed on the internet. Un-ignore a new station layer explicitly.
*
!.gitignore
!evaldo-sp/
!evaldo-sp/**

# evaldo-sp: station-private and bulky files never enter git (2026-09-28):
# the apprise token store (secrets, refreshed from tokens.txt by do-setup22)
# and the BirdNET+ V3 model pack (fetched on first use — US-45 story doc)
evaldo-sp/apprise-tokens.txt
evaldo-sp/model/*.onnx
evaldo-sp/model/*_Labels.csv
evaldo-sp/model/*_Labels.txt
evaldo-sp/model/*_ScoreBlacklist.json
